<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-TIGER CUP TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TIGER CUP TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Tiger Cup soccer</p>
<p>tournament group B matches played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>In Singapore:</p>
<p>    Brunei    0   Malaysia   6 </p>
<p>Scorers - K.Sanbagamaran (3rd minute), Samsurin Abd Rahman</p>
<p>(37th), Anuar Abu Bakar (47th, 60th), M.Chandran (82nd, 89th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000 </p>
<p>    Singapore 0   Thailand   1</p>
<p>Scorer - Natipong Sritong-in (68th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 42,000 </p>
<p>Final group B standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p> Thailand    4  3  1  0  13  1   10 </p>
<p> Malaysia    4  2  2  0  15  2    8 </p>
<p> Singapore   4  2  1  1   7  2    7</p>
<p> Brunei	4  1  0  3   1  15   3</p>
<p> Philippines 4  0  0  4   0  16   0</p>
<p>Thailand qualify for semifinals.</p>
</text>
